  "body": "https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/d9f092285b28f0cdac0d985813a1cabd8ea990b6/synapse/federation/transport/client.py#L928-L930\r\nhttps://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/d9f092285b28f0cdac0d985813a1cabd8ea990b6/synapse/federation/transport/client.py#L972-L974\r\n\r\nThese `close()` calls were added in #12875, but I overlooked that we'd only close the first coroutine if it raised an `IncompleteJSONError`.\r\nWe need to close _all_ coroutines, even when any of them raise an error.\r\n\r\nUntil we fix this properly, we'll get unhelpful `Exception ignored in: <generator object utf8_encoder at 0x7f87c9b1ccf0>` errors in sentry without a stack trace or logging context.",
